	(text "TPS26631: UV/OV chain mandatory (UVLO to GND means 15.46 V, would kill a 12 V rail). Latch mode, supervisor clears. SHDN default off.\nTPS22965 has no current limit, its 6 A is under the buck limit: polyfuse after each switch, 5 V 2.5 A, 3.3 V 1.1 A.\nOutput limits: 24 V 3.61 A, Jetson 2.98 A, third 2.98 A, aux 3.97 A, Pi stub 3.61 A, 7.4 V 5.98 A, spare 3.61 A (TPS26631 latch off). 5 V 2.5 A, 3.3 V 1.1 A (polyfuse, hold at 23 C, derates hot).\nINA238 has no energy registers: firmware integrates at 100 Hz, or swap to INA228 (same footprint)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 572 0)
